  "description": "In the floating world of beauty and illusion, love is the most dangerous secret of all.\nYou arrive as a stranger… but soon, one glance, one whispered word, changes everything.\n\nEach geisha hides a story  of duty, desire, and dreams long buried beneath layers of silk and silence.\nAs you grow closer, your choices will shape a fragile bond that could either blossom into forbidden love… or fade like cherry petals in the wind.\n\nWill you be the one to free her heart… or let her disappear into the shadows of tradition?\n\nHow far would you go for love that was never meant to be?\n\n\nGame Features:\n\n● Romance among the blossoms: Fall for captivating geishas, each with her own past, secrets, and emotions waiting to unfold.\n\n● Your choices decide her fate: Comfort her, challenge her, or confess your feelings. Every decision changes your shared destiny.\n\n● A poetic journey through the floating world: Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of beauty, melancholy, and passion.\n\n● Multiple endings: Discover the bittersweet paths of love, freedom, and sacrifice.\n\n● A visual novel of emotion and elegance: Where every word, glance, and gesture can change the course of a heart.\n\n\nWill you risk everything to love a geisha who can never be yours?",
